1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,220
演講 演講
Speech! Speech!

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,740
好啦好啦 都靜一下
Okay, okay, okay. Settle down.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,420
真不敢相信我50歲了
It's hard to believe I'm 50.

4
00:00:08,868 --> 00:00:11,178
從今天開始 我就步入中年了
A-A-As of today, I'm middle-aged.

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,440
那他過去十年算什么
What's he been the last 10 years?

6
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,800
妄想狂 他以為自己跟我們一樣是千禧一代
Delusional. He thinks he's a millennial, like us.

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,780
我思考了很多 關于接下來會如何
I've thought a lot about what's next.

8
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,600
-變51歲 -謝謝你啊 兄弟
- 51. - Thank you, buddy.

9
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,400
重要的是 我要繼續成長
And it's important that I continue to grow

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,400
并且繼續接受精神上的挑戰[當弱智]
and that I stay mentally challenged.

11
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,260
所以我要開始
Which is why I am starting...

12
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,720
學鋼琴
piano lessons,

13
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,380
這樣到明年生日時
so that by next year's birthday,

14
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,580
我就厲害到能當眾演奏了
I'll be good enough to perform in public.

15
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,580
太好了 又有破事要去參加
Oh, great. Another thing to go to.

16
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,380
還有 我要學講西班牙語
Also, I'm gonna learn how to speak Spanish.

17
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:38,540
好棒哦[西語]
Excelente!

18
00:00:40,149 --> 00:00:41,699
我還沒開始學 聽不懂
Uh, I -- I haven't started yet.

19
00:00:41,939 --> 00:00:43,499
最終
Um, and finally, um --

20
00:00:43,499 --> 00:00:46,589
我知道這算是老掉牙的中年危機事項
and I know it's a little bit of a midlife-crisis cliché,

21
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,060
不過
but...

22
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:50,440
我打算學騎獨輪車
I'm gonna learn how to ride a unicycle!

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:54,740
菲爾 有份禮物你忘記拆了
Phil, you forgot to open one of your gifts.

24
00:00:55,799 --> 00:00:59,259
這一份 是杰親手為你選的
This one, Jay picked it up for you himself.

25
00:00:59,280 --> 00:00:59,860
真的嗎
He did?

26
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:00,740
爸爸
Hey, Dad.

27
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:02,519
你干嘛戴那頂帽子
So, what's going on with that hat?

28
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:05,120
歌洛莉亞覺得我在我們家庭聚會拍的大合照里
Gloria thinks I look grumpy in the photos that we take

29
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,000
都很臭臉
when we go to these things,

30
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,440
所以我在尋找最合適的帽子
so I'm searching for the right hat

31
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,940
能讓我看起來玩得很開心
that makes me look like I'm having fun.

32
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:12,000
或者你多笑一點也行啊
Or you could just smile more.

33
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:17,600
《品酒師的法國紅酒指南》
"The Sommelier's Guide to the Wines of France."

34
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,880
-我太喜歡了 -真不錯
- I love it so much. - Nice!

35
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,580
老天爺 上面還題了字
Oh, my goodness. It's inscribed.

36
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:25,200
"愿你像上等波爾多紅酒般
"May you continue to age

37
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,980
繼續優雅地老去"
as gracefully as a fine Bordeaux."

38
00:01:28,419 --> 00:01:30,529
-爸爸 -"生日快樂 杰
- Dad... - "Happy Birthday, Jay.

39
00:01:30,529 --> 00:01:31,319
愛你的 小卡"
Love, Cam."

40
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:34,479
小卡 沒錯 杰 你把我送你的禮物轉送人啊
...Cam. Yeah. Jay, you re-gifted my gift?

41
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:35,060
爸爸
Dad!

42
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,300
我不知道他在里面寫字了
I didn't know he wrote in it.

43
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:37,360
因為你都沒打開過
Because you didn't open it.

44
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:38,680
現在我覺得自己好混蛋
So now I feel like a jerk.

45
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:40,800
你怎么會是混蛋呢 你可是戴著那頂可愛的小帽子
How could you be a jerk? You're wearing that hat.

46
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:47,880
一年后 我就知道她在說什么了
A year from now, I'm gonna know what that means.

47
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:03,160
我給歌洛莉亞準備了最棒的情人節禮物
I got Gloria the greatest Valentine's Day gift --

48
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:07,480
喜劇演員迪恩·馬丁的全套吐槽作品集
a box set of DVDs of all the Dean Martin Roasts.

49
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,580
我被如此浪漫的舉動深深打動了
I was so moved by the romantic gesture

50
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:11,900
于是杰生日那天
that for Jay's birthday,

51
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:15,220
我邀請了一群人來羞辱他
I invited a bunch of people over to insult him.

52
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:18,940
我前妻和我
So, my ex-wife and I,

53
00:02:19,010 --> 00:02:21,350
我們跟杰和歌洛莉亞一起去度假
we were on vacation with Jay and Gloria.

54
00:02:21,350 --> 00:02:23,450
他倆沿著海灘漫步 我前妻說
They're walking down the beach, and my ex-wife says,

55
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,480
"天啊 露出那么大面積的皮膚"
"Whoa, look at all that skin."

56
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:27,600
我便說 "寶貝 別這樣
And I said, "Baby, come on.

57
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,540
那有什么問題呢
What's wrong with that?

58
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,840
她是個穿著比基尼的美麗女子"
She's a beautiful woman in a bikini."

59
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,140
她說 "不 我是在說杰的頭皮"
She said, "Oh, I'm talkin' about Jay's scalp."

60
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:40,800
杰毫無拉丁血統
Jay is so not Latin

61
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:43,700
沒有的程度達到他只要開始跳舞
that every time that he dances,

62
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,920
都有人告訴他洗手間在哪
people point him to the bathroom.

63
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:49,540
他毫無節奏感 我意思是
He has no rhythm. That's what I mean.

64
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:52,800
不過說真的 我很喜歡白人
But seriously, I love the whites.

65
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:55,780
不 說真的 杰是不折不扣的環保人士
No, but seriously, Jay is quite the environmentalist.

66
00:02:55,820 --> 00:02:58,120
去年 他就把我送他的禮物回收利用了
Just this last year, he recycled a gift of mine --

67
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,700
是一本關于上等紅酒的好書
a wonderful book about wine.

68
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,610
我不想說我爸年紀很大
I-I don't want to say my father is old,

69
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:09,250
不過他對1000年電腦千年蟲的恐懼還記憶猶新
but he remembers panicking at Y-1-K.

70
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:13,260
我爸很老了
My dad is old.

71
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,300
他有多老
How old is he?

72
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,520
他一開始用白宮H牌痔瘡膏那個年代
He's so old that when he started using it,

73
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,160
那還叫白宮家御用古方痔瘡膏
it was called Preparation G.

74
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:22,060
夠了
Enough!

75
00:03:22,820 --> 00:03:24,120
你們太過分了
This is terrible!

76
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:27,240
我不懂你們為什么覺得好笑
I don't know why any of you people think this is funny!

77
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:31,580
你們可能覺得這些只是玩笑 但其實太真實了
You may think these are jokes, but it's way too real.

78
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:35,000
我們應該尊敬外公 而不是揭他老底
We need to respect Grandpa instead of cutting him down.

79
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:38,420
沒人知道他還能活多久
None of us really knows how much time he has left.

80
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:40,880
你們真的希望這是他人生最后聽到的話嗎
Do you really want these to be the last words he hears?

81
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,520
現在我難受死了
Well, now I feel like hell.

82
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:45,500
這才叫吐槽 炸裂
And that's how you roast! Bam!

83
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,660
我不懂大人為什么把生日
I don't understand why adults make such a big deal

84
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:52,580
搞得那么隆重
about their birthdays.

85
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,760
所以今年 我沒有任何要求
So this year, I asked for nothing.

86
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,760
不搞派對 不搞活動
No party, no fuss.

87
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,680
一個人靜靜度過那晚
Just a quiet night by myself,

88
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,680
與我的思想獨處
with my thoughts, all alone.

89
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:04,780
好了
Okay.

90
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,700
跟我希望的一樣 米奇爾凄慘到不行
Just as I had hoped, Mitchell is miserable.

91
00:04:07,951 --> 00:04:08,991
他說他不想辦派對
He said he didn't want a party,

92
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,180
但這就跟你在邀請函上寫"不用送禮"
but it's like when you write "No gifts" on an invitation

93
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:13,040
其實暗中希望所有人都帶大份
but you secretly want everyone to bring something

94
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,120
又昂貴的禮物來一樣 約坦
big and expensive, Jotham.

95
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:16,120
我在你的派對上發表了真誠的祝酒辭
I made a heartfelt toast at your party.

96
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,720
沒錯 那12個詞跟其他人帶來的實體禮物
Yes, and those 12 words were just as generous

97
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,860
同樣慷慨大方
as the actual physical gifts everyone else brought.

98
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,780
好 我要進去了
Okay, I'm gonna go in.

99
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,520
你們聽到我說"米奇爾 你不是一個人"后
When you hear me say "Mitchell, you're not alone,"

100
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,780
你們就沖進來大喊"驚不驚喜"
that's when you come in and you yell "Surprise."

101
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,280
我們知道該說什么
We know what to say.

102
00:04:29,461 --> 00:04:30,942
你真的知道嗎
Mm. Do you?

103
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,740
-你怎么樣 還好嗎 -嗯
- How you doing? Okay? - Yeah.

104
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:38,440
現在你知道獨自過生日是什么樣了吧
Now do you see what it's like to spend your birthday alone?

105
00:04:38,651 --> 00:04:40,471
知道了 這...
I do. And it's...

106
00:04:40,471 --> 00:04:41,491
-對 -簡直太棒了
- Yeah. - ...amazing.

107
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:43,780
-什么 -小卡 謝謝你 謝謝你
- What? - Cam, thank you. Thank you.

108
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:46,500
你終于有一次聽進去我的話 給我我想要的
For once, you heard me and gave me exactly what I wanted

109
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:48,360
而不是你以為我該想要的
instead of what you thought I should want.

110
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:51,000
親愛的 這是我收到過最棒的生日禮物
Honey, this is the best birthday present ever.

111
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:52,220
-真的嗎 -真的
- It is? - Yes!

112
00:04:52,391 --> 00:04:54,352
你一定也松了一口氣吧
Oh, and you've -- you've got to be relieved, too.

113
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,140
我們每次跟那群朋友玩
I mean, every time we hang out with our friends,

114
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:57,900
他們走后 你都花一整晚
they leave and you spend the rest of the night

115
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:00,320
抱怨他們每一個人都哪里惹到你了
complaining about how every single one of them annoys you.

116
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:01,640
我不知道你在說什么
I don't know what you're talking about!

117
00:05:01,682 --> 00:05:04,922
少來 約坦很小氣 勒邁克有口臭
Oh, please. Jotham's cheap. L'Michael has bad breath.

118
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,240
我才不會說這種話
That doesn't sound like me!

119
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,340
安東尼奧的編發都快散架了
Antonio's weave is falling apart.

120
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:09,940
文森特喝醉后都失控
Vincent's a sloppy drunk.

121
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,480
還有 杰弗里每次都把女星
Oh, oh, Jeffrey won't stop telling

122
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,320
伯納黛特·彼特斯的同個故事拿出來講
his one Bernadette Peters story.

123
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,260
你喝醉后才失控呢
You're the sloppy drunk!

124
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,240
驚不驚喜
Surprise!

125
00:05:20,352 --> 00:05:22,222
我發現了一件事
Here's a thing I realized --

126
00:05:22,222 --> 00:05:25,042
只要不過生日 就永遠不會老
you can't get older if you never have birthdays.

127
00:05:30,722 --> 00:05:32,512
? 祝你生日... ?
♪ Happy birth-- ♪

128
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,880
我說什么來著
What'd I tell you?

129
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,160
我以為今年她終于會坦然接受
I thought this would be the year.

130
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:40,420
我之前跟家人說 今年生日
I told my family I just wanted my birthday

131
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:42,680
我只想跟迪蘭兩個人過 因為當時
to be me and Dylan this year because at the time,

132
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,600
我還沒告訴家人我懷孕了
I was still keeping my pregnancy a secret,

133
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,980
我知道他們見到我不喝酒
and I knew they'd get all suspicious

134
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,020
肯定會開始懷疑
about why I wasn't drinking.

135
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:48,260
我能怎么說
What was I going to say?

136
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:49,900
"我要早起工作所以不能喝酒"嗎
"I can't drink because I have work in the morning"?

137
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,620
他們才不可能相信
There's no way they'd believe that.

138
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,320
給 我給你準備了禮物
Here. I got you a present.

139
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:56,820
謝謝你
Thank you!

140
00:05:58,700 --> 00:05:59,500
不是吧
Get out!

141
00:05:59,862 --> 00:06:01,542
古琦嬰兒鞋
Gucci baby sneakers!

142
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:03,880
真可愛
They're adorable.

143
00:06:04,852 --> 00:06:06,732
我們的寶寶會很性感的
Our baby's gonna be so hot.

144
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:07,940
就我個人來說 我覺得這很怪
Personally, I think it's weird

145
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:09,720
寶寶還不會走路為什么要穿鞋
that there are shoes for someone who can't walk.

146
00:06:09,862 --> 00:06:10,992
但你知道嗎 海莉
But you know what, Haley?

147
00:06:10,992 --> 00:06:13,472
我們懷了寶寶我真高興
I love that we're pregnannnt --

148
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,220
你們好
Hello!

149
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,100
你們倆怎么會在這
What are you guys doing here?

150
00:06:18,172 --> 00:06:19,312
在這間餐廳嗎 我們
At the restaurant? We got a --

151
00:06:19,312 --> 00:06:20,862
-我們買了團購券 -我們也是
- We got a Groupon, but we -- - Us too.

152
00:06:20,862 --> 00:06:22,772
我們只是看到你們倆在這邊
Yeah, we j-we just saw that you were over here.

153
00:06:22,772 --> 00:06:24,403
-想過來說聲生日快樂 -生日快樂
- Wanted to say happy birthday. - Happy birthday.

154
00:06:24,403 --> 00:06:25,633
我們無意偷聽
Didn't mean to overhear.

155
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,700
你們什么都沒聽到
You didn't overhear anything.

156
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:28,500
我們剛才說的是電視劇
We were talking about a TV show.

157
00:06:28,563 --> 00:06:29,843
那這些
Oh, well, then, what's-what's up

158
00:06:29,843 --> 00:06:30,753
這些嬰兒鞋是怎么回事
with these little baby shoes, then?

159
00:06:30,753 --> 00:06:32,433
這些不是嬰兒鞋
These are-these are not baby shoes.

160
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,760
不是 這些是
No, they're, um...

161
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,320
我們要創業
We are starting a business

162
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:38,820
賣這些給買不起正常尺寸奢侈品的人
for people who cannot afford full-size designer wear.

163
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:42,220
盡管聽起來像是你會做的事 我
Oh. Well, as much as that does sound like you, I --

164
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:42,680
好吧
Okay.

165
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:46,200
-我懷孕了 -我的天
- I'm pregnant. - Oh, my God.

166
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,020
太令人激動了
That's exciting!

167
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:48,820
-是嗎 -我們覺得是
- Is it? - We think so.

168
00:06:48,820 --> 00:06:50,620
但我們還沒告訴我父母
But we have not told my parents yet,

169
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:52,140
所以拜托什么都別說
so please don't say anything.

170
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,720
親愛的 我可以永遠為你保守秘密
Oh, honey, I could keep your secret forever,

171
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,840
但你得知道 他做不到
but just so you know, he can't.

172
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:57,640
是的 我嘴不嚴
Yeah, I'm weak.

173
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,440
他最多只能忍住三四天
Yeah, you got maybe three, four days tops.

174
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:00,980
-什么 -是的
- What? - Yeah.

175
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:03,200
好吧 這些本來是我們送的 可是
Okay. Well, these were from us, but...

176
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,420
她不能喝酒 她懷孕了
Yeah, she can't have it. She's pregnant.

177
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,560
這就說了 你瞧
Okay, there you go. See?

178
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:07,560
你給我聽好
Now, you listen to me.

179
00:07:07,703 --> 00:07:09,063
我過山車一樣的荷爾蒙
My roller-coastering hormones

180
00:07:09,063 --> 00:07:10,783
現在不能應付我媽再對我說教
cannot handle another lecture from my mother right now,

181
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,200
所以你得告訴我一個秘密
so you are going to tell me a secret

182
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:15,760
假如你泄密 我就告訴所有人
that I will reveal to everyone if you ever spill mine!

183
00:07:16,233 --> 00:07:17,873
可我沒有任何秘密
Yeah, but I don't have any secrets.

184
00:07:17,873 --> 00:07:19,643
他扮成費茲波的時候
Uh, when he dresses as Fizbo,

185
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:22,020
全身每一處地方都要化妝
he puts the makeup everywhere.

186
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:23,680
你最好了
You're the best.

187
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,820
因為21歲生日是件大事
Because of the whole 21 thing,

188
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:30,120
人們不覺得20歲生日有多重要
people don't think turning 20 is a big deal.

189
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:34,400
但過去三年里我腦子里只想著這件事
But it's all I've been thinking about for the last three years.

190
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:40,080
三年前 我到這家店來
Three years ago, I came in here,

191
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,780
一看到你就愛上了你
and when I saw you, I fell in love.

192
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,840
是那種對人沖擊很大
The kind of love that punches you in the gut

193
00:07:45,393 --> 00:07:47,083
讓我想變得更優秀的愛情
and makes you wanna be a better man.

194
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:49,080
但我約你出去時 你說
But when I asked you out, you said,

195
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:50,020
"抱歉 孩子 你很可愛
"Sorry, kid. You're cute,

196
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:51,580
但我不跟青少年約會"
but I don't date teenagers."

197
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,320
你看
Well... check it out.

198
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,880
生日快樂
Happy birthday!

199
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,820
可現在我不跟"男人"約會了
But now I don't date men.

200
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:03,760
看來我有個重大決定要做
Well...looks like I've got a decision to make.

201
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,320
我今年過生日時
On my birthday this year,

202
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,820
真的明白了人們是怎么看我的
I really got a sense of what people think of me.

203
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:11,180
那真是
Which is...

204
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:12,600
好啊
so great.

205
00:08:12,894 --> 00:08:14,344
這是我和小伙子們合送的
This is from me and the boys.

206
00:08:14,344 --> 00:08:16,204
歌洛莉亞單獨給你準備了禮物
Gloria got you her own gift.

207
00:08:16,780 --> 00:08:19,040
包裝得真精美
Wow, this is wrapped so nicely!

208
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,140
是我包的
I did that.

209
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:22,220
在當代是門失落的藝術
It's a lost art in this modern age

210
00:08:22,220 --> 00:08:24,580
人們點擊幾下就在網上把禮物送出去了
where people simply click and ship gifts over the Internet.

211
00:08:24,834 --> 00:08:26,464
寶貝 正常點
Papi, just be normal.

212
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:28,184
我們看看 這是
Let's see. It is, uh...

213
00:08:28,634 --> 00:08:30,354
真絲枕頭嗎
some kind of silk pillow?

214
00:08:30,354 --> 00:08:31,334
不止如此
Well, it's more than that.

215
00:08:31,334 --> 00:08:33,634
你看 側面有一個開關
See, there's a switch on the side,

216
00:08:33,634 --> 00:08:36,654
躺上去時能播放大海的聲音
and when you lay on it, it-it plays ocean sounds for you.

217
00:08:36,654 --> 00:08:38,344
能幫助你放松
You know, I-it helps you relax.

218
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,200
至少不是轉送別人的禮物
At least it's not a re-gift.

219
00:08:40,774 --> 00:08:42,264
-你怎么能忍受跟他過日子 -我
- How do you live with this? - I...

220
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:43,900
這樣吧
Tell you what.

221
00:08:44,114 --> 00:08:45,774
不如我們再拆一個禮物
How about we do one more gift, and then

222
00:08:45,774 --> 00:08:48,064
-然后吃蛋糕休息一下再拆 -好
we take a break for cake and do the rest after? Yeah.

223
00:08:48,644 --> 00:08:51,164
給 鄧菲太太 這是我和海莉送的
Here, Mrs. Dunphy. This is from me and Haley.

224
00:08:51,204 --> 00:08:52,645
謝謝你 迪蘭
Mm, thank you, Dylan.

225
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:53,480
但我不得不說
Although I have to say,

226
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:56,100
今年你們已經給我足夠的大禮了
you have given me enough gifts this year already.

227
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,880
我再次為搞大您女兒肚子的事道歉
Again, I'm very sorry about impregnating your daughter.

228
00:08:58,880 --> 00:08:59,700
是啊
Yeah.

229
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,880
這是什么
What is this?

230
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:04,480
是臺香薰機
It's an aromatherapy machine.

231
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,620
你把精油加進去
See, you put in oils

232
00:09:05,620 --> 00:09:07,240
應該能幫你緩解一天的壓力
that are supposed to help you with the stress of the day.

233
00:09:08,704 --> 00:09:10,634
好吧 我們看看
Alright, well... let's see.

234
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,160
目前為止 我收到了全天水療
So far, I have gotten a spa day,

235
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,540
三份按摩
three massages,

236
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:17,620
冥想課 海洋枕頭
a meditation class, an ocean pillow,

237
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:20,040
發泄球棒 和一臺小機器
a rage bat, and a little machine

238
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:22,200
欺騙我的鼻子讓我平靜下來
that's supposed to trick my nose into calming me down.

239
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:23,680
為什么每個人都覺得我精神緊繃
Why does everyone think I'm so tense?

240
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,320
你的夜間牙套都咬爛了
You bit through your night guard.

241
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,720
你把我勒得太緊了
You're squeezing me too hard.

242
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,660
上周 你把藥劑師罵哭了
And last week, you made the pharmacist cry.

243
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:32,260
那是因為她不肯再賣我速達菲
That's because he wouldn't sell me any more Sudafed.

244
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,540
全家都病了
The entire family was sick.

245
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,440
我不是要制冰毒
I was not cooking meth.

246
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:37,380
你們知道嗎 我根本不想吃蛋糕
You know what? I don't even want cake.

247
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:39,840
我真的不喜歡你們這樣評判我
I really don't appreciate being criticized like this,

248
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,180
特別是在我生日這天
especially on my birthday.

249
00:09:44,595 --> 00:09:47,365
那是我的禮物 晚點再拆
Um, that's my gift. Open later.

250
00:09:48,525 --> 00:09:50,165
曼尼和我同一天過生日
Manny and I share a birthday,

251
00:09:50,165 --> 00:09:52,995
所以我總是大張旗鼓博取注意
so I always do something big to get attention.

252
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,760
快看 不用手扶
Look! No hands!

253
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:57,200
-做得好 孩子 -太棒了 寶貝
- Way to go, kid! - Bravo, papi!

254
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:59,060
大伙 快看
Hey, guys! Check it out.

255
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:01,060
我騎獨輪車去上鋼琴課
Unicycling to my piano lesson.

256
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,640
我們真為你驕傲
Wow! We're so proud of you!

257
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,820
太厲害了
Now, that's impressive.

258
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,420
生日快樂 喬
Happy birthday, Joe!

259
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,400
原本挺快樂的
It was!

260
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,860
不用說大家也知道
It goes without saying

261
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:12,500
我是家族里最優秀的表演者
I'm the best performer in the family.

262
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:15,560
我今年過生日時 決定辦一場才藝演出
This year, for my birthday, I decided to have a talent show

263
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,960
好讓大家都開始稱贊這事實
so they all start saying it.

264
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:18,620
等等
Wait.

265
00:10:18,885 --> 00:10:20,865
今天是才藝演出嗎 我都不知道
It's a talent show? I-I didn't know that.

266
00:10:20,865 --> 00:10:22,565
邀請函上寫了啊
It said so on the invitation.

267
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:22,860
米奇爾
Mitchell?

268
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,160
我就隨便掃了一下
I only skimmed it.

269
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,240
這下糟了
This is a disaster.

270
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,700
我們可什么都沒有準備
We didn't prepare anything!

271
00:10:27,225 --> 00:10:27,226
? 沒有什么能比卡羅萊納的早晨 ?
♪ Nothing could be finer than to be in Carolina ♪

272
00:10:27,226 --> 00:10:30,515
Carolina in the Morning - Gus Kahn

273
00:10:30,515 --> 00:10:33,745
? 更加美妙 ?
♪ In the morning ♪

274
00:10:34,335 --> 00:10:36,525
? 沒人能比我的摯愛更加甜美 ?
♪ No one could be sweeter than my sweetie... ♪

275
00:10:36,525 --> 00:10:38,755
真不敢相信他們車里有成對的馬甲
I can't believe they had matching vests in their car.

276
00:10:38,980 --> 00:10:40,620
暴脾氣叔叔 你為什么這么生氣
Uncle Grumpy, why are you so angry?

277
00:10:40,865 --> 00:10:45,145
因為總統想建隔離墻
Because the President wants to build a wall!

278
00:10:45,155 --> 00:10:47,255
是啊 是挺悲哀的
Ay, yeah, that is very sad.

279
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:48,360
只是對我來說
Sad for me,

280
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:52,060
因為我又沒錢又丑
because I have no money and I am ugly.

281
00:10:52,195 --> 00:10:56,226
你不一樣 他會讓你進來的 因為你有錢
For you, he would let you in because you have money

282
00:10:56,226 --> 00:10:58,436
還是大胸美女
and you have the boobs.

283
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,980
我都不知道暴脾氣叔叔會講政治哏
I never thought Uncle Grumpy would go political.

284
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:10,400
我就知道我還不行
I knew I wasn't ready!

285
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,100
? 蝴蝶翩翩起舞 ?
♪ Butterflies all flutter up ♪

286
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:14,780
? 親吻美麗花朵 ?
♪ And kiss each little buttercup... ♪

287
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,180
斯黛拉 轉圈圈
Stella, walk in a circle.

288
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:17,580
斯黛拉 坐下
Stella, sit.

289
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:18,900
砰
Bang!

290
00:11:19,296 --> 00:11:20,956
可惜差一點哦 爸
Ohh. Ah. Close, Dad.

291
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:23,180
沒有 我就是教她抱住槍口
No, I taught her to go for the gun.

292
00:11:25,420 --> 00:11:26,720
自從我看了那部恐怖片
The banjo scares me ever since

293
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,060
班卓琴就給我留下了陰影
I saw that creepy film.

294
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,700
等等 那個電影叫什么來著
Wait. What was it called, again?

295
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:30,760
《激流四勇士》嗎
"Deliverance"?

296
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:32,740
不是 是《布偶大電影》
No. The Muppet Movie.

297
00:11:34,096 --> 00:11:36,236
他是三趾樹蛙 她是兩趾樹蛙
He was a three-toed tree toad, but a two-toed toad was she.

298
00:11:36,236 --> 00:11:36,946
三趾樹蛙
The three-toed tree toad

299
00:11:36,946 --> 00:11:38,366
想得到兩趾樹蛙的心
tried to win the two-toed shetoad's heart,

300
00:11:38,366 --> 00:11:39,766
因為三趾樹蛙喜歡
for the three-toed tree toad loved the ground

301
00:11:39,766 --> 00:11:40,976
兩趾樹蛙腳下的土地
that the two-toed tree toad trod.

302
00:11:40,976 --> 00:11:42,457
"樹蛙腳下的土地" 發送
"...tree toad trod." And sent.

303
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:46,460
太厲害了
Stop it!

304
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:48,080
西部最快拇指
Fastest thumbs in the West!

305
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:52,980
? 如果我能有一天擁有阿拉丁神燈 ?
♪ If I had Aladdin's lamp for only a day ♪

306
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:56,670
? 我會許個愿 這是我要許的愿望 ?
♪ I would make a wish, and here's what I'd say ♪

307
00:11:57,100 --> 00:12:00,380
? 沒有什么能比卡羅萊納的早晨 ?
♪ Nothing could be finer than to be in Carolina ♪

308
00:12:00,486 --> 00:12:04,546
? 更加美妙 ?
♪ In the mooorniiing ♪

309
00:12:04,546 --> 00:12:06,266
大家都知道 雪莉和我是因為我們
As you all know, Sherry and I met

310
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,820
對即興表演共同的愛而相遇相愛
and fell for each other over our love of improv.

311
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:12,040
那么現在 我們是在一個浪漫的餐廳
So, we're at a romantic restaurant.

312
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:12,980
好的
Okay.

313
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:17,220
晚餐很好吃
That dinner was delicious.

314
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:19,560
我真不敢相信你選了這個地方
I can't believe you chose this place.

315
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,780
這里的主廚是我前男友
The chef is my ex-boyfriend.

316
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:23,100
瘋子前男友嗎
The crazy one?

317
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:23,720
是的
Yes.

318
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,980
他嫉妒心很強
He's very jealous,

319
00:12:24,980 --> 00:12:27,140
我擔心他對你的食物動了手腳
and I'm scared he did something to your food.

320
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:29,840
我感覺有點不太好[搞笑]
I am feeling a little funny.

321
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,620
我倒希望這能稍微搞笑點
I wish this were a little funny.

322
00:12:34,667 --> 00:12:36,327
這個房間在轉嗎 我
I-Is this room spinning? I --

323
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:36,860
沒有
No.

324
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:38,560
我怕是中毒了
I was afraid of that.

325
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,620
那我最好趁還來得及趕緊做了
Well, then I better do this before it's too late.

326
00:12:41,700 --> 00:12:43,260
這一部分是真的
And this part is real.

327
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:44,880
雪莉·夏克爾
Sherry Shaker,

328
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,480
我以前都是獨角戲
I used to be a one-man show,

329
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,580
直到你從舞臺左側進場
and then you entered from stage left,

330
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:50,800
我墜入愛河
and I fell in love.

331
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,080
我希望
I want you

332
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:55,480
你能永遠做我的屏幕伴侶
to be my scene partner forever.

333
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:59,320
親愛的 讓我們一起讓朋友們見證
Darling, let's force our friends to sit through

334
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,700
我們的余生
the rest of our lives together.

335
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:04,620
你愿意嫁給我嗎
Will you marry me?

336
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:06,260
我的天
Oh, my God.

337
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:08,160
曼尼
Manny!

338
00:13:09,660 --> 00:13:10,220
不要
No!

339
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,360
你為什么要這么做
Why would you do this?!

340
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:20,420
至少現在你的鋼琴表演不是最糟心的了
You gotta be feeling better about that piano.

341
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:27,260
我都不想聊我今年的生日
I'd rather not talk about my birthday this year.

342
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:30,660
? 祝你生日快樂 親愛的莉莉 ?
♪ Happy birthday, dear Lily ♪

343
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:35,780
? 祝你生日快樂 ?
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

344
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:37,840
我還是不敢相信雪莉拒絕了我
I still can't believe Sherry said no

345
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,760
還跟我分手
and broke up with me.

346
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:40,620
那他想怎么樣 他現在才二十歲
What does he expect? He's 20 years old.

347
00:13:40,660 --> 00:13:43,260
在全家人面前搞了個想象的餐廳求婚
He proposed in front of his family at a pretend restaurant.

348
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,220
說好的"我愿意"情節呢
Whatever happened to "Yes and"?

349
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,580
杰 我什么都試過了
Jay, I've tried everything.

350
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:49,460
你快說點什么能讓他好受點的話吧
Please say something to him that will make him feel better.

351
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:49,960
行吧
Fine.

352
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,680
孩子 別想了
Kid, let it go.

353
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,040
都四天了
It was four days ago.

354
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:55,660
好了 來許個愿
Alright, let's make a wish!

355
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,000
我希望我死了
I wish I were dead.

356
00:13:59,180 --> 00:13:59,660
好啦
Alright.

357
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:01,640
許完了 挺好
There we go.

358
00:14:03,858 --> 00:14:05,878
海莉和我計劃了好多年
Haley and I have had this plan for years

359
00:14:05,878 --> 00:14:08,738
等我21歲的時候 我們要一起去酒吧
that when I turn 21, we'd hit the bars together.

360
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:11,740
但是因為她懷孕了 我算是在喝兩人份
But since she's pregnant, I was drinking for two.

361
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:13,820
準確地說 四人份
Technically, four.

362
00:14:17,118 --> 00:14:19,568
我告訴你 海莉·鄧菲
Let me tell you something, Haley Dunphy.

363
00:14:19,568 --> 00:14:22,328
你知道我有多佩服你嗎
Do you know how much I admire you?

364
00:14:22,328 --> 00:14:23,188
知道嗎
Do you?

365
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,520
五體投地
So much!

366
00:14:25,058 --> 00:14:27,548
我忙上忙下累得像狗一樣
While I was working my butt off,

367
00:14:27,548 --> 00:14:29,378
你卻能在外面逍遙自在
you were out there having fun!

368
00:14:29,378 --> 00:14:31,038
無憂無慮
Not worrying about anything --

369
00:14:31,100 --> 00:14:33,020
不想學校 不想工作
not school, not work...

370
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:34,940
不想避孕
not condoms.

371
00:14:35,318 --> 00:14:37,678
看看你 挺著大肚子
Look at you -- all preg-a-nant.

372
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:40,340
或許我應該讓比爾也把我肚子搞大
Maybe I should have Bill come get me pregnant.

373
00:14:41,068 --> 00:14:44,058
這樣我們就可以一起懷孕了 那多有意思
Then we can be pregnant together! That would be fun!

374
00:14:44,098 --> 00:14:45,189
我的手機呢
Where's my phone?

375
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,900
我要給他發短信讓他過來搞大我肚子
I'm gonna text him to come get me pregnant.

376
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,180
你知道嗎
You know what?

377
00:14:49,678 --> 00:14:51,348
都什么時代了
It's 2000-something.

378
00:14:51,348 --> 00:14:53,078
是我要搞大他的肚子
I'm gonna get him pregnant!

379
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:55,040
我真想念喝傻的日子
I miss drinking.

380
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:58,200
不像其他人 我喜歡我的生日
Unlike some people, I love my birthday.

381
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:01,060
這是一年中可以以我為中心的一天
It's the one day a year that can be all about me.

382
00:15:04,778 --> 00:15:06,608
好了 我覺得我們每個人輪流
So, um, I thought it would be fun

383
00:15:06,608 --> 00:15:07,998
講講自己愛小卡哪一點
if we all went around the room

384
00:15:07,998 --> 00:15:10,078
肯定很有意思
and say what we love about Cam.

385
00:15:10,548 --> 00:15:13,178
這可真是意外 不過你要堅持的話就來吧
Well, that's out of nowhere, but if you insist.

386
00:15:13,178 --> 00:15:14,408
海莉 不如你先開始
Haley, why don't you go first?

387
00:15:14,408 --> 00:15:15,578
我嗎 好的
Oh, me? Okay.

388
00:15:15,578 --> 00:15:18,088
這個嘛 我愛小卡舅舅
Well, um... I love Uncle Cam

389
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:20,600
因為他很有意思而且穿衣有品
because he is fun and dresses with flair.

390
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:21,380
真不好意思
Oh, my gosh.

391
00:15:22,139 --> 00:15:25,909
還有 我也愛他讓米奇爾舅舅很幸福這點
And, uh, I love that he makes my Uncle Mitchell happy.

392
00:15:27,089 --> 00:15:28,649
還有還有 我愛你們 因為你們最先知道
Oh, also, I love that you guys were the first ones

393
00:15:28,649 --> 00:15:31,399
我懷孕了卻沒有給我講大道理評判我
to find out I was pregnant and you never judged me.

394
00:15:32,100 --> 00:15:33,500
等一等 你這話什么意思
Wait a minute. What are you talking about?

395
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:35,320
我以為我們是同時知道的
I thought we all found out at the same time.

396
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:36,460
這個嘛
Oh, uh... Well...

397
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:38,880
米奇爾 你早知道她懷孕了卻沒有告訴我
Mitchell, you knew she was pregnant and you didn't tell me?

398
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:40,480
我覺得這件事不該由我向你開口嘛
I didn't think it was my place.

399
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,260
好啦 下一個是誰
Anyway, who's next?

400
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:43,600
誰來說"我最愛小卡的是他..."
"What I love about Cam is..."

401
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:46,080
我只是希望你起碼能有一次在背后支持我
I just wish you would have my back just once.

402
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:48,080
看來她沒有用我送她的"按摩器"
I don't think she's been using my gift.

403
00:15:48,239 --> 00:15:50,309
-? 祝小卡生日快樂 ? -停 別唱了
- ♪ Happy birthday to Cam, happy... ♪ - Stop. Drop it.

404
00:15:50,309 --> 00:15:51,499
歡迎來到我的世界
Welcome to my world.

405
00:15:51,499 --> 00:15:54,219
我生日的時候 大家只在乎愛哭鬼曼尼
At my birthday, all anyone cared about was weepy Manny

406
00:15:54,219 --> 00:15:56,049
被他女朋友給甩了
'cause Sherry broke up with him.

407
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,400
她現在有新男朋友了
She has a boyfriend now.

408
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:59,900
干得漂亮 莉莉
Way to go, Lily.

409
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:01,060
干得漂亮
Way to go!

410
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,760
您老貴庚啊
How old are you?

411
00:16:15,449 --> 00:16:17,739
快51了 再...
I turn 51 in, uh...

412
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,000
這么多天就是了
this many days.

413
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,220
我老爸也有過中年危機
My dad had a midlife crisis, too.

414
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:25,300
我在他的公寓里有只倉鼠
I have a hamster at his condo.

415
00:16:25,509 --> 00:16:27,269
不 不是中年危機
No. N-No midlife crisis.

416
00:16:27,269 --> 00:16:30,359
我只是覺得... 人活到老學到老嘛
I just think you're -- you're never too old to learn.

417
00:16:31,540 --> 00:16:32,940
求你高抬貴手 別靠近我媽
Just stay away from my mom.

418
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:35,289
我媽對廢柴沒有抵抗力
She has a thing for losers.

419
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:39,200
你還好嗎
Are you okay?

420
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:40,400
我們是不是該帶你去醫院了
Should we take you to the hospital?

421
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:42,860
對啊 陣痛的間隔越來越短了
Yeah, the contractions are getting closer together.

422
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,200
不行 老爸是下一個
No. Dad is next.

423
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:46,340
我可以再為他多忍幾分鐘
I can hold it for a few minutes, okay?

424
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:48,040
我不想搞砸他的發表會
I don't want to screw this up for him.

425
00:16:54,290 --> 00:16:56,630
要命 在那之后出場也太慘了
Yikes. Hate to follow that.

426
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:58,600
兄臺你準備用那首曲子技驚四座
What are you gonna dazzle us with?

427
00:16:58,920 --> 00:16:59,500
《致愛麗絲》
"Fur Elise."

428
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:02,650
哪個調 荒腔走調的調嗎
In which key -- "B" obvious?

429
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:06,380
下一位 是我唯一會剃胡子的學生
Next up, the only student of mine who shaves.

430
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:07,840
菲爾·鄧菲
Phillip Dunphy.

431
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:20,600
當我滿50歲的時候 我發誓要做一些
When I turned 50, I vowed to do some things

432
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:22,480
走出自己舒適圈的事情
to take me out of my comfort zone

433
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:25,320
讓自己不會松懈倦勤 在此我想感謝我的家人
and keep me on my toes, and I want to thank my family

434
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:26,940
永遠當我最大的拉拉隊
for being my biggest cheerleaders.

435
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,100
我也愛你 閨女
I love you, too, honey.

436
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:30,300
不是 海莉要生了
No, Haley's going into labor!

437
00:17:30,300 --> 00:17:31,320
我們得送她去醫院了 老公
We've got to get her to the hospital, honey!

438
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,860
我試著忍住了 對不起 老爸
Oh! I tried to hold it! I'm sorry, Dad!

439
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,820
天啊 抱歉了 各位
Oh, my God. I'm so sorry, everyone!

440
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:35,940
真"巧"啊
Convenient.

441
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:52,480
好 太棒啦 走
Yes! Great! Come on!

442
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:53,840
親愛的 你真棒
Great work, honey.

443
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:55,900
替我跟你老母問聲好
Tell your mom I say hi.

444
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:00,840
迪蘭
Dylan!

445
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,540
一切都還好吧
Is everything okay?

446
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,380
不
No.

447
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:07,660
是一切都太美妙了
Everything's amazing.

448
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,760
你干嘛這么嚇人啊
Why would you say it that way?

449
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:10,740
海莉沒事
Haley's fine.

450
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:12,460
她好勇敢
She was so brave.

451
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:14,340
孩子們也很棒
And the babies are great!

452
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,980
我都等不及要見他們了
I can't wait to see them!

453
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,800
等他們接受完檢查就行了
As soon as they're done getting checked out.

454
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:19,130
我現在去把孩子抱來
I'm gonna go get them now.

455
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,000
等等
Wait, wait.

456
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,220
性[別]呢
What about the sex?

457
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:22,940
醫生說我跟海莉得起碼休息六周
Doctor says not for six weeks.

458
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:28,160
請問這里是鄧菲房嗎
Is this the Dunphy suite?

459
00:18:29,021 --> 00:18:30,951
孩子的媽怎么樣啦
Oh, how's the mommy?

460
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:33,500
消毒液 各位 都來用
Hand sanitizer, everyone. Here you go.

461
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:34,480
你還好嗎 孩子
How you doing, kiddo?

462
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,700
有點累 我昨晚太操勞了
A little tired. I overdid it last night.

463
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,560
兒子 我覺得他不是在問你
I don't think he was talking to you, buddy.

464
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:40,160
有點心力交瘁
It's overwhelming.

465
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:42,120
心里有點五味雜陳
Just feeling so many different emotions.

466
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:43,660
我還挺棒的
I'm also doing great.

467
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:45,860
我生了一個兒子一個女兒
I have a son and a daughter,

468
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:48,780
等他們把孩子弄干凈就行了 他們超可愛
and once they washed them off, they were really cute.

469
00:18:49,481 --> 00:18:50,731
打算起什么名字呢
Oh, what are their names?

470
00:18:50,731 --> 00:18:53,701
我們打算先不決定 等麻醉過了再說
We're gonna put a pin in that until the drugs wear off.

471
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:57,140
沒人的孫子們應該被起做皮克斯與科切拉
Nobody needs grandchildren named Pixar and Coachella.

472
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,800
菲爾 這是給你的
Phil, this is for you.

473
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:03,100
是... 提前給你的生日禮物
It's a...little early birthday present.

474
00:19:03,111 --> 00:19:05,941
而我承認 這禮物是轉送的二手貨
And I admit, this one is a re-gift.

475
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,200
"世上最棒的外公"
"World's Best Grandfather."

476
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:12,700
這是海莉出生時我送給你的杯子
It's the mug I gave you when Haley was born.

477
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:13,820
你這些年來居然一直留著
You kept it all these years.

478
00:19:13,861 --> 00:19:16,411
是啊 但是... 現在是你的了
Yeah. But, uh... it's yours now.

479
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:18,060
我用不上了 我有個新頭銜
I don't need it anymore. I got a new title.

480
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:20,780
"外曾祖母"嗎
"Great grandma"?

481
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:23,500
靠 我買錯個了
Oh, hell. I grabbed the wrong one.

482
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:23,800
給你
Here.

483
00:19:24,771 --> 00:19:25,921
我就數到三
I'm going to count to three.

484
00:19:25,921 --> 00:19:26,682
好的
Yeah.

485
00:19:26,860 --> 00:19:28,560
發布會怎么樣了 菲爾
Hey, how was your recital, Phil?

486
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,480
我把場面搞得一團亂
Oh, I messed it all up for him.

487
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:31,700
抱歉了 老爸
Sorry about that, Dad.

488
00:19:31,771 --> 00:19:34,231
我知道那是你今年的大目標
I-I know that was your big goal for the year.

489
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,100
我現在有個更大的目標了
I have a better one now.

490
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:38,080
米阿莫費黑摸索[西語]
Mi ano fue hermoso.

491
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,820
我今年很美
My year was beautiful.

492
00:19:40,691 --> 00:19:42,771
"阿諾"才是"年"
"Año" means "year."

493
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:44,600
"阿莫"是"屁眼"
"Ano" means "Anus."

494
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:46,540
還是通啦
Still works.

495
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:48,620
各位
Hey, everybody.

496
00:19:49,261 --> 00:19:52,022
孩子們呢 我想見見他們
Ay, where are the babies? I want to see them.

497
00:19:52,022 --> 00:19:54,392
這件事很難跟你們開口
There's no easy way to say this.

498
00:19:56,152 --> 00:19:58,672
但米奇爾跟小卡說想表演一段
Mitch and Cam have a whole thing they want to do.

499
00:19:58,712 --> 00:20:00,812
天啊 比我想的還慘
Oh, God. It's worse than I thought.

500
00:20:00,812 --> 00:20:06,092
? 爸爸 有頭獅子出生了 ?
♪ Nants ingonyama bagithi baba ♪

501
00:20:06,132 --> 00:20:08,722
天啊 我愛死了
Oh, my God! I love it so much!

502
00:20:13,552 --> 00:20:16,342
? 是生命的循環 ?
♪ It's the circle of life ♪

503
00:20:16,342 --> 00:20:18,472
真不敢相信他們車里有成對的袍子
I can't believe they had matching robes in their car.

504
00:20:18,472 --> 00:20:20,582
? 帶領著我們向前 ?
♪ And it moves us all ♪

505
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:21,780
他們真是太美了
They're so beautiful!

506
00:20:23,822 --> 00:20:26,862
? 穿越絕望與希望 ?
♪ Through despair and hope ♪

507
00:20:26,862 --> 00:20:27,612
你做得很棒
Good job.

508
00:20:27,612 --> 00:20:29,562
你們兩個都會有狗狗床
You're both gonna get dog beds.

509
00:20:29,562 --> 00:20:31,932
? 越過信念與愛 ?
♪ Through faith and love ♪

510
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,360
下一個輪到你啦
You're next, huh?

511
00:20:33,762 --> 00:20:35,572
行行行 我就隨口一說
Okay. Okay. I'm just saying.

512
00:20:36,012 --> 00:20:39,772
? 是那循環 ?
♪ It's the circle ♪

513
00:20:39,772 --> 00:20:41,092
真棒 孩子
Good job, kid.

514
00:20:41,092 --> 00:20:47,282
? 那生命的循環 ?
♪ The circle of life ♪

515
00:20:50,122 --> 00:20:52,022
天啊 他還在哭嗎
Oh... Is he still crying?

516
00:20:52,022 --> 00:20:54,122
對啊 都哭了幾小時了
Yeah. Has been for hours...

517
00:20:54,482 --> 00:20:55,882
我本來以為他哭睡了呢
I thought he cried himself to sleep.

518
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:56,620
可憐的小家伙
Poor little guy.

519
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:57,900
他吃過東西了嗎
Has he eaten anything?

520
00:20:58,140 --> 00:20:59,420
我一個小時前喂過他了
I fed him an hour ago.

521
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:01,480
真是厲害 他們一個好得不行
It's amazing how one can be fine

522
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,980
而另一個哭得這么凄慘
and the other one is so upset.

523
00:21:03,172 --> 00:21:03,992
你去睡吧
You go up to bed.

524
00:21:03,992 --> 00:21:05,142
我睡前最后再去看他一回
I'll check him up one last time.

525
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:05,720
謝了 老媽
Thanks mom.

526
00:21:06,542 --> 00:21:10,232
這不是我勇敢的大男孩嗎
There is my big brave boy.

527
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:12,340
雪莉預定要去拍一個牙膏廣告了
Sherry booked a toothpaste commercial.

528
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:16,380
我接下來要整天看到她美麗的笑容了
I'm going to have to see that beautiful smile all the time.

529
00:21:17,722 --> 00:21:19,812
來來來 哭吧哭吧
There, there, let it out.
